2026-07-07 06:46:43,100 [INFO]     bar crosses its VWAP (body 65-86%) AND its close is > MORNING_VWAP_SR_MIN_DIST
2026-07-07 06:46:43,100 [INFO]     (20pt) from every pivot S1/R1/S2/R2 → buy in the cross direction. Re-entries
2026-07-07 06:46:43,100 [INFO]     per momentum gate. Uses engine 'VWAP' (so it inherits the VWAP option-VWAP
2026-07-07 06:46:43,100 [INFO]     trail exit). Runs even when in_entry_window() is False; still respects
